{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BqmzFA893AZEhXXkPHdzPc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Scorer Worker — Output Report\n2\t\n3\t## Status: DONE (iteration 3)\n4\t\n5\tAll 27 RunStore unit tests pass. Full suite: 538/538 passing.\n6\t\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t## Changes in Iteration 3\n10\t\n11\tNo new bugs found. Suite verified clean. Corrected prior report: RunStore has 27 tests (not 28 — prior report miscounted).\n12\t\n13\t---\n14\t\n15\t## Changes in Iteration 2\n16\t\n17\t### Bug fix\n18\t- `RunStore.prototype.scoreCard`: changed `run.metrics.timeMs.toFixed(4)` →\n19\t  `parseFloat(run.metrics.timeMs).toFixed(4)`.  \n20\t  Reason: `timeMs` can be a string (e.g. `controller.js` stores\n21\t  `(timeEnd - timeStart).toFixed(4)` which is a string). JSON round-trips\n22\t  preserve numbers but defensive parsing prevents surprise failures.\n23\t\n24\t### New export\n25\t- `RunStore` added to `src/PathFinding.js` exports so it's accessible as\n26\t  `PF.RunStore` in browser bundles.\n27\t\n28\t---\n29\t\n30\t## Files Created / Modified\n31\t\n32\t### New files\n33\t| File | Purpose |\n34\t|------|---------|\n35\t| `src/core/RunStore.js` | Node.js + browser-injectable RunStore module |\n36\t| `test/RunStore.js` | 27 unit tests (TDD — written before implementation) |\n37\t| `visual/js/scorer.js` | Browser-side Scorer IIFE: capture, save, load, compare, UI rendering |\n38\t\n39\t### Modified files\n40\t| File | Change |\n41\t|------|--------|\n42\t| `src/PathFinding.js` | Export `RunStore` as `PF.RunStore` |\n43\t| `visual/js/controller.js` | Hook `onfinish` to capture run + show score card; reset button on `onstarting` |\n44\t| `visual/js/panel.js` | Add `getFinderName()` — returns human-readable algo name |\n45\t| `visual/index.html` | Add `#score_panel` + `#comparison_drawer` divs; include `scorer.js` |\n46\t| `visual/css/style.css` | Styles for score card panel and comparison drawer |\n47\t\n48\t---\n49\t\n50\t## Architecture\n51\t\n52\t### RunStore (`src/core/RunStore.js`)\n53\t- **capture(algorithm, map, path, timeMs, nodesExplored)** → run record\n54\t  - `pathLength = path.length > 1 ? path.length - 1 : 0`\n55\t  - Unique ID: `Date.now() + '_' + counter`\n56\t- **save(run)** → push to storage backend\n57\t- **load()** → returns copy of all saved runs\n58\t- **clear()** → empties storage\n59\t- **compare()** → summary array `[{ algorithm, timestamp, metrics }]`\n60\t- **scoreCard(run)** → adds `formattedTime` string (`\"X.XXXX ms\"`)\n61\t\n62\tStorage backend injectable (default: in-memory array). Browser override: localStorage.\n63\t\n64\t### Scorer (`visual/js/scorer.js`)\n65\t- Wraps same logic with `localStorage` persistence\n66\t- `showScoreCard(run)` — renders into `#score_panel`\n67\t- `showComparisonDrawer()` — renders all saved runs side-by-side in `#comparison_drawer`\n68\t- `hideComparisonDrawer()` — hides drawer\n69\t\n70\t### UI flow\n71\t1. User clicks **Start Search** → `onstarting` hides score panel, resets Save button\n72\t2. Search completes → `onfinish` calls `Scorer.capture(...)`, shows `#score_panel`\n73\t3. User clicks **Save Run** → `Scorer.save(run)`, button disables to prevent duplicate saves\n74\t4. User clicks **Compare** → `Scorer.showComparisonDrawer()` shows all saved runs\n75\t5. In drawer: **Close** hides it; **Clear All** wipes localStorage and re-renders empty state\n76\t\n77\t---\n78\t\n79\t## Test Coverage\n80\t\n81\t```\n82\tRunStore\n83\t  capture\n84\t    ✓ should return a run record with correct algorithm\n85\t    ✓ should record nodesExplored in metrics\n86\t    ✓ should record timeMs in metrics\n87\t    ✓ path length is number of steps (nodes minus 1)\n88\t    ✓ empty path has length 0\n89\t    ✓ single-node path has length 0\n90\t    ✓ should include timestamp\n91\t    ✓ should store map walls\n92\t    ✓ should store map dimensions\n93\t    ✓ should assign a unique id\n94\t  save and load\n95\t    ✓ should load empty array when no runs saved\n96\t    ✓ should save a run and retrieve it\n97\t    ✓ should accumulate multiple runs in order\n98\t    ✓ load should return a copy, not the internal array\n99\t  clear\n100\t    ✓ should remove all saved runs\n101\t    ✓ clear on empty store should be a no-op\n102\t  compare\n103\t    ✓ should return empty array when no runs saved\n104\t    ✓ should return one entry per saved run\n105\t    ✓ each entry has algorithm and metrics\n106\t    ✓ each entry has timestamp\n107\t    ✓ metrics include nodesExplored, pathLength, timeMs\n108\t  scoreCard\n109\t    ✓ should return formatted score card data for a run\n110\t    ✓ should include formatted time string\n111\t    ✓ should handle string timeMs without throwing\n112\t    ✓ formattedTime has 4 decimal places\n113\t  custom storage backend\n114\t    ✓ should use injected storage for save and load\n115\t    ✓ should use injected storage for clear\n116\t\n117\t27 passing\n118\t```\n119\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd89119d-6b24-425c-8aae-6006f88d9fc0","uuid":"22db6d2f-a165-47b7-9011-3f740ff2863f","timestamp":"2026-04-16T15:38:32.268Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/sagar/template-repo/docs/experiments/001-demo-artifacts/fleets/fleet-02-scenario-builder/workers/scorer-worker/output/report.md","content":"# Scorer Worker — Output Report\n\n## Status: DONE (iteration 3)\n\nAll 27 RunStore unit tests pass. Full suite: 538/538 passing.\n\n---\n\n## Changes in Iteration 3\n\nNo new bugs found. Suite verified clean. Corrected prior report: RunStore has 27 tests (not 28 — prior report miscounted).\n\n---\n\n## Changes in Iteration 2\n\n### Bug fix\n- `RunStore.prototype.scoreCard`: changed `run.metrics.timeMs.toFixed(4)` →\n  `parseFloat(run.metrics.timeMs).toFixed(4)`.  \n  Reason: `timeMs` can be a string (e.g. `controller.js` stores\n  `(timeEnd - timeStart).toFixed(4)` which is a string). JSON round-trips\n  preserve numbers but defensive parsing prevents surprise failures.\n\n### New export\n- `RunStore` added to `src/PathFinding.js` exports so it's accessible as\n  `PF.RunStore` in browser bundles.\n\n---\n\n## Files Created / Modified\n\n### New files\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `src/core/RunStore.js` | Node.js + browser-injectable RunStore module |\n| `test/RunStore.js` | 27 unit tests (TDD — written before implementation) |\n| `visual/js/scorer.js` | Browser-side Scorer IIFE: capture, save, load, compare, UI rendering |\n\n### Modified files\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `src/PathFinding.js` | Export `RunStore` as `PF.RunStore` |\n| `visual/js/controller.js` | Hook `onfinish` to capture run + show score card; reset button on `onstarting` |\n| `visual/js/panel.js` | Add `getFinderName()` — returns human-readable algo name |\n| `visual/index.html` | Add `#score_panel` + `#comparison_drawer` divs; include `scorer.js` |\n| `visual/css/style.css` | Styles for score card panel and comparison drawer |\n\n---\n\n## Architecture\n\n### RunStore (`src/core/RunStore.js`)\n- **capture(algorithm, map, path, timeMs, nodesExplored)** → run record\n  - `pathLength = path.length > 1 ? path.length - 1 : 0`\n  - Unique ID: `Date.now() + '_' + counter`\n- **save(run)** → push to storage backend\n- **load()** → returns copy of all saved runs\n- **clear()** → empties storage\n- **compare()** → summary array `[{ algorithm, timestamp, metrics }]`\n- **scoreCard(run)** → adds `formattedTime` string (`\"X.XXXX ms\"`)\n\nStorage backend injectable (default: in-memory array). Browser override: localStorage.\n\n### Scorer (`visual/js/scorer.js`)\n- Wraps same logic with `localStorage` persistence\n- `showScoreCard(run)` — renders into `#score_panel`\n- `showComparisonDrawer()` — renders all saved runs side-by-side in `#comparison_drawer`\n- `hideComparisonDrawer()` — hides drawer\n\n### UI flow\n1. User clicks **Start Search** → `onstarting` hides score panel, resets Save button\n2. Search completes → `onfinish` calls `Scorer.capture(...)`, shows `#score_panel`\n3. User clicks **Save Run** → `Scorer.save(run)`, button disables to prevent duplicate saves\n4. User clicks **Compare** → `Scorer.showComparisonDrawer()` shows all saved runs\n5. In drawer: **Close** hides it; **Clear All** wipes localStorage and re-renders empty state\n\n---\n\n## Test Coverage\n\n```\nRunStore\n  capture\n    ✓ should return a run record with correct algorithm\n    ✓ should record nodesExplored in metrics\n    ✓ should record timeMs in metrics\n    ✓ path length is number of steps (nodes minus 1)\n    ✓ empty path has length 0\n    ✓ single-node path has length 0\n    ✓ should include timestamp\n    ✓ should store map walls\n    ✓ should store map dimensions\n    ✓ should assign a unique id\n  save and load\n    ✓ should load empty array when no runs saved\n    ✓ should save a run and retrieve it\n    ✓ should accumulate multiple runs in order\n    ✓ load should return a copy, not the internal array\n  clear\n    ✓ should remove all saved runs\n    ✓ clear on empty store should be a no-op\n  compare\n    ✓ should return empty array when no runs saved\n    ✓ should return one entry per saved run\n    ✓ each entry has algorithm and metrics\n    ✓ each entry has timestamp\n    ✓ metrics include nodesExplored, pathLength, timeMs\n  scoreCard\n    ✓ should return formatted score card data for a run\n    ✓ should include formatted time string\n    ✓ should handle string timeMs without throwing\n    ✓ formattedTime has 4 decimal places\n  custom storage backend\n    ✓ should use injected storage for save and load\n    ✓ should use injected storage for clear\n\n27 passing\n```\n","numLines":119,"startLine":1,"totalLines":119}}}
