 and load\n    ✓ should load empty array when no runs saved\n    ✓ should save a run and retrieve it\n    ✓ should accumulate multiple runs in order\n    ✓ load should return a copy, not the internal array\n  clear\n    ✓ should remove all saved runs\n    ✓ clear on empty store should be a no-op\n  compare\n    ✓ should return empty array when no runs saved\n    ✓ should return one entry per saved run\n    ✓ each entry has algorithm and metrics\n    ✓ each entry has timestamp\n    ✓ metrics include nodesExplored, pathLength, timeMs\n  scoreCard\n    ✓ should return formatted score card data for a run\n    ✓ should include formatted time string\n    ✓ should handle string timeMs without throwing\n    ✓ formattedTime has 4 decimal places\n  custom storage backend\n    ✓ should use injected storage for save and load\n    ✓ should use injected storage for clear\n\n27 passing\n\nFull suite: 576 passing\n```\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":48,"newStart":1,"newLines":46,"lines":[" # Scorer Worker — Output Report"," ","-## Status: DONE (iteration 3)","+## Status: DONE (iteration 4)"," ","-All 27 RunStore unit tests pass. Full suite: 538/538 passing.","+All 27 RunStore unit tests pass. Full suite: 576 passing."," "," ---"," ","-## Changes in Iteration 3","+## Summary"," ","-No new bugs found. Suite verified clean. Corrected prior report: RunStore has 27 tests (not 28 — prior report miscounted).","+No regressions. No new issues. All requirements satisfied."," "," ---"," ","-## Changes in Iteration 2","+## Requirements Coverage"," ","-### Bug fix","-- `RunStore.prototype.scoreCard`: changed `run.metrics.timeMs.toFixed(4)` →","-  `parseFloat(run.metrics.timeMs).toFixed(4)`.  ","-  Reason: `timeMs` can be a string (e.g. `controller.js` stores","-  `(timeEnd - timeStart).toFixed(4)` which is a string). JSON round-trips","-  preserve numbers but defensive parsing prevents surprise failures.","+| Requirement | Status |","+|-------------|--------|","+| Metrics capture: nodes explored, path length, time (ms) | ✓ `RunStore.capture()` |","+| Score card display after each run | ✓ `Scorer.showScoreCard()` → `#score_panel` |","+| Comparison drawer: side-by-side runs | ✓ `Scorer.showComparisonDrawer()` → `#comparison_drawer` |","+| Save run (algorithm + map + metrics + timestamp) | ✓ `Scorer.save()` → localStorage |","+| Load saved runs for comparison | ✓ `Scorer.load()` / `Scorer.compare()` |","+| Clear all saved runs | ✓ `Scorer.clear()` |"," ","-### New export","-- `RunStore` added to `src/PathFinding.js` exports so it's accessible as","-  `PF.RunStore` in browser bundles.","-"," ---"," ","-## Files Created / Modified","+## Files"," ","-### New files","+### Created"," | File | Purpose |"," |------|---------|"," | `src/core/RunStore.js` | Node.js + browser-injectable RunStore module |"," | `test/RunStore.js` | 27 unit tests (TDD — written before implementation) |","-| `visual/js/scorer.js` | Browser-side Scorer IIFE: capture, save, load, compare, UI rendering |","+| `visual/js/scorer.js` | Browser-side Scorer IIFE: capture, save, load, compare, UI |"," ","-### Modified files","+### Modified"," | File | Change |"," |------|--------|"," | `src/PathFinding.js` | Export `RunStore` as `PF.RunStore` |","-| `visual/js/controller.js` | Hook `onfinish` to capture run + show score card; reset button on `onstarting` |","-| `visual/js/panel.js` | Add `getFinderName()` — returns human-readable algo name |","-| `visual/index.html` | Add `#score_panel` + `#comparison_drawer` divs; include `scorer.js` |","+| `visual/js/controller.js` | `onfinish` captures run + shows score card; `onstarting` resets Save button |","+| `visual/js/panel.js` | `getFinderName()` — human-readable algo name |","+| `visual/index.html` | `#score_panel` + `#comparison_drawer` divs; include `scorer.js` |"," | `visual/css/style.css` | Styles for score card panel and comparison drawer |"," "," ---"]},{"oldStart":54,"oldLines":17,"newStart":52,"newLines":16,"lines":["   - `pathLength = path.length > 1 ? path.length - 1 : 0`","   - Unique ID: `Date.now() + '_' + counter`"," - **save(run)** → push to storage backend","-- **load()** → returns copy of all saved runs","+- **load()** → copy of all saved runs"," - **clear()** → empties storage"," - **compare()** → summary array `[{ algorithm, timestamp, metrics }]`"," - **scoreCard(run)** → adds `formattedTime` string (`\"X.XXXX ms\"`)","+- Storage backend injectable (default: in-memory array); browser override: localStorage"," ","-Storage backend injectable (default: in-memory array). Browser override: localStorage.","-"," ### Scorer (`visual/js/scorer.js`)","-- Wraps same logic with `localStorage` persistence","+- Wraps same logic with localStorage persistence"," - `showScoreCard(run)` — renders into `#score_panel`","-- `showComparisonDrawer()` — renders all saved runs side-by-side in `#comparison_drawer`","+- `showComparisonDrawer()` — all saved runs side-by-side in `#comparison_drawer`"," - `hideComparisonDrawer()` — hides drawer"," "," ### UI flow"]},{"oldStart":76,"oldLines":7,"newStart":73,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," ---"," ","-## Test Coverage","+## Test Results"," "," ```"," RunStore"]},{"oldStart":115,"oldLines":4,"newStart":112,"newLines":6,"lines":["     ✓ should use injected storage for clear"," "," 27 passing","+","+Full suite: 576 passing"," ```"]}],"originalFile":"# Scorer Worker — Output Report\n\n## Status: DONE (iteration 3)\n\nAll 27 RunStore unit tests pass. Full suite: 538/538 passing.\n\n---\n\n## Changes in Iteration 3\n\nNo new bugs found. Suite verified clean. Corrected prior report: RunStore has 27 tests (not 28 — prior report miscounted).\n\n---\n\n## Changes in Iteration 2\n\n### Bug fix\n- `RunStore.prototype.scoreCard`: changed `run.metrics.timeMs.toFixed(4)` →\n  `parseFloat(run.metrics.timeMs).toFixed(4)`.  \n  Reason: `timeMs` can be a string (e.g. `controller.js` stores\n  `(timeEnd - timeStart).toFixed(4)` which is a string). JSON round-trips\n  preserve numbers but defensive parsing prevents surprise failures.\n\n### New export\n- `RunStore` added to `src/PathFinding.js` exports so it's accessible as\n  `PF.RunStore` in browser bundles.\n\n---\n\n## Files Created / Modified\n\n### New files\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `src/core/RunStore.js` | Node.js + browser-injectable RunStore module |\n| `test/RunStore.js` | 27 unit tests (TDD — written before implementation) |\n| `visual/js/scorer.js` | Browser-side Scorer IIFE: capture, save, load, compare, UI rendering |\n\n### Modified files\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `src/PathFinding.js` | Export `RunStore` as `PF.RunStore` |\n| `visual/js/controller.js` | Hook `onfinish` to capture run + show score card; reset button on `onstarting` |\n| `visual/js/panel.js` | Add `getFinderName()` — returns human-readable algo name |\n| `visual/index.html` | Add `#score_panel` + `#comparison_drawer` divs; include `scorer.js` |\n| `visual/css/style.css` | Styles for score card panel and comparison drawer |\n\n---\n\n## Architecture\n\n### RunStore (`src/core/RunStore.js`)\n- **capture(algorithm, map, path, timeMs, nodesExplored)** → run record\n  - `pathLength = path.length > 1 ? path.length - 1 : 0`\n  - Unique ID: `Date.now() + '_' + counter`\n- **save(run)** → push to storage backend\n- **load()** → returns copy of all saved runs\n- **clear()** → empties storage\n- **compare()** → summary array `[{ algorithm, timestamp, metrics }]`\n- **scoreCard(run)** → adds `formattedTime` string (`\"X.XXXX ms\"`)\n\nStorage backend injectable (default: in-memory array). Browser override: localStorage.\n\n### Scorer (`visual/js/scorer.js`)\n- Wraps same logic with `localStorage` persistence\n- `showScoreCard(run)` — renders into `#score_panel`\n- `showComparisonDrawer()` — renders all saved runs side-by-side in `#comparison_drawer`\n- `hideComparisonDrawer()` — hides drawer\n\n### UI flow\n1. User clicks **Start Search** → `onstarting` hides score panel, resets Save button\n2. Search completes → `onfinish` calls `Scorer.capture(...)`, shows `#score_panel`\n3. User clicks **Save Run** → `Scorer.save(run)`, button disables to prevent duplicate saves\n4. User clicks **Compare** → `Scorer.showComparisonDrawer()` shows all saved runs\n5. In drawer: **Close** hides it; **Clear All** wipes localStorage and re-renders empty state\n\n---\n\n## Test Coverage\n\n```\nRunStore\n  capture\n    ✓ should return a run record with correct algorithm\n    ✓ should record nodesExplored in metrics\n    ✓ should record timeMs in metrics\n    ✓ path length is number of steps (nodes minus 1)\n    ✓ empty path has length 0\n    ✓ single-node path has length 0\n    ✓ should include timestamp\n    ✓ should store map walls\n    ✓ should store map dimensions\n    ✓ should assign a unique id\n  save and load\n    ✓ should load empty array when no runs saved\n    ✓ should save a run and retrieve it\n    ✓ should accumulate multiple runs in order\n    ✓ load should return a copy, not the internal array\n  clear\n    ✓ should remove all saved runs\n    ✓ clear on empty store should be a no-op\n  compare\n    ✓ should return empty array when no runs saved\n    ✓ should return one entry per saved run\n    ✓ each entry has algorithm and metrics\n    ✓ each entry has timestamp\n    ✓ metrics include nodesExplored, pathLength, timeMs\n  scoreCard\n    ✓ should return formatted score card data for a run\n    ✓ should include formatted time string\n    ✓ should handle string timeMs without throwing\n    ✓ formattedTime has 4 decimal places\n  custom storage backend\n    ✓ should use injected storage for save and load\n    ✓ should use injected storage for clear\n\n27 passing\n```\n","userModified":false}}
